  "description": "The Double Peak i/O is made of Proprietary X6 alloy and sports distinctively smooth and flowy lines designed to lower stand over height and center of gravity. In addition , it includes proprietary SpeedStays for outstanding handling and performance. It comes with a semi complete Deore 10 speed 1X drive train and is powered by both you and Shimano's STePS 6050 mid motor drive unit programed for on road and light off road use. Double Peak i/O comes equipped with a Suntour XCM ebike specific suspension fork with 100mm of travel with lockout. It rolls along on Kenda Honey Badger 27.5\" x 2.20 60tpi tires mounted to a pair of Pivit 32h alloy double wall rims, and the rolling stops courtesy of Shimano M365 hydraulic disk brakes.",
